<title>HONG KONG: Trading in Golden Island shrs suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Golden Island shrs suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of restaurant operator Golden Island (Holdings) Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Monday.  </p>
<p>The company's shares ended HK$0.02 lower at HK$1.72 on Friday. Volume was 3.02 million shares worth HK$5.53 million.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370  http://www.hk97.com</p>
